--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8ab2da1d08f4fcb4380d1a1569c9ce14, type: 3}
  m_Name: ChatResponse_Love
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _classType: 500
  _list:
  - _responseId: 0
    _responseFI: "Olisi ihanaa pelata yhdess\xE4, tuu mukaan jos silt\xE4 tuntuu."
    _responseEN: I'd love to be together... I mean play together, join in if you
      want a good time.
  - _responseId: 1
    _responseFI: "Pelattaisko toinen, ihan rauhassa ja yhdess\xE4?"
    _responseEN: Interested in another one? Just you me and the game.
  - _responseId: 2
    _responseFI: "Tulen mielell\xE4ni, yhdess\xE4 pelaaminen tuntuu hyv\xE4lt\xE4."
    _responseEN: I'll come since it feels better together.
  - _responseId: 3
    _responseFI: "Haluan liitty\xE4 teihin. Tuntuu, ett\xE4 kuulun t\xE4nne."
    _responseEN: I want to join you. It feels like I belong here.
  - _responseId: 4
    _responseFI: "Kyll\xE4, rakkaudella. Kiitos ett\xE4 kysyit."
    _responseEN: Absolutely, with love. Thank you for asking.
  - _responseId: 5
    _responseFI: "Ei t\xE4ll\xE4 kertaa, mutta arvostan, ett\xE4 ajattelit minua."
    _responseEN: Not this time but I appreciate that you thought of me.
  - _responseId: 6
    _responseFI: "Hei rakkaat, t\xE4\xE4ll\xE4 ollaan!"
    _responseEN: Hello lovelies, I'm baa-ack!
  - _responseId: 7
    _responseFI: "Kiitos kaikille t\xE4st\xE4. L\xE4hden nyt syd\xE4n t\xE4ynn\xE4."
    _responseEN: Thank you all for this. I'll leave now with you all in my heart.
  - _responseId: 8
    _responseFI: "Jaksakaa viel\xE4 hetki rakkaani, olen poissa vain sekunnin!"
    _responseEN: Try to manage my lovelies, I'll be gone for just a moment.
  - _responseId: 9
    _responseFI: "Oi, suloinen voitto, syleile minua viel\xE4 kerran!"
    _responseEN: Oh, you sweet victory let me embrace you once again.
  - _responseId: 10
    _responseFI: "Me h\xE4vit\xE4\xE4n yhdess\xE4, ja sekin on okei. Olette silti
      t\xE4rkeit\xE4 mulle."
    _responseEN: We'll lose together and thats okay. You still matter to me.
  - _responseId: 11
    _responseFI: "Tervetuloa Discordiin, siell\xE4 voi oikeasti l\xF6yt\xE4\xE4 yhteyden.
      Linkki nettisivuilta!"
    _responseEN: Come to Discord where we can find a connection. Link is at the website.
  - _responseId: 12
    _responseFI: "Tunnen yksin\xE4isyytt\xE4, mutta teid\xE4n l\xE4sn\xE4olo lohduttaa."
    _responseEN: I feel lonely but I know you lovelies are still there for me.
  - _responseId: 13
    _responseFI: "Rakastan t\xE4t\xE4 peli\xE4, koska se toi mut teid\xE4n luo."
    _responseEN: I love this game because it brought me to you.
  - _responseId: 14
    _responseFI: 'Peli on pettymys, mut te ette ole. Te teette sen arvokkaaksi. '
    _responseEN: Game's a dissapointment but you guys are not. You are what gives
      it value.
  - _responseId: 15
    _responseFI: "En osaa t\xE4t\xE4, mut jos autatte, opimme yhdess\xE4."
    _responseEN: I don't how to do this, but if you'll help we can learn together.
